#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:151
#: 20f9f241096540d99b88b36cbeb9ff42
msgid "**Goal:** Control the robot via VR or isomorphic teleop."
msgstr "**目标：** 通过 VR 或同构遥操作控制机器人。"

