"dual-arm: `git clone -b panthera-ht …` then `./init_repo.sh` / "
"`./quick_start.sh`"
msgstr ""
"**[高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)** — "
"双臂：`git clone -b panthera-ht …` 然后 `./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"

