msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:223
#: 67b4f2cc32a9462a8ab0eb2571d2ee95
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → "
"composer `task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:225
#: 23bd165f2bd3460b88d43813ea7f9a37
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md). "
"Documented composer/lerobot branches are `feature/dex-grasp-generator` "
"and `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`. Stop at recording/export; skip training."
msgstr ""
"见 [合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。文档对应的 composer/lerobot "
"分支是 `feature/dex-grasp-generator` 与 `feature/sim-grasp-"
"datagen`。停在录制/导出；跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:227
#: 65fd3d60f4144bbb9cdadcd4f170c8d7
